name figput
category Package
revision 63957
shortdesc Create interactive figures in LaTeX
relocated 1
longdesc FigPut allows figures to be specified using JavaScript. The
longdesc resulting document can be viewed as a static PDF, as usual, or
longdesc the document can be viewed in a web-browser, in which case the
longdesc figures are interactive. A variety of interactive widgets are
longdesc included.
runfiles size=7
